@title A toast stands above the tool dock, never over it
@area Layout
# C3-06: at 1366 wide the toast column reached the dock's left buttons. The export's "written" toast stays until clicked, like an error toast (a unit test covers the error one).
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text export pdf
wait 6
key Enter
wait 15
shot toast-and-dock
check_layout
